    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83337e6af8bcd7b35cf5eaa4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表在“日本德比”中获胜。\n兴奋的观众们热烈讨论着\n她果然是能超越“神话”的人才。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2486a09005b85b60aa60d97375580ff2d1a519f3db0c01d83479d4f139de1831",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5623ee6772590b2a717aca47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表毫不在意这些评价。\n然后，她得知鲁道夫象征在出道之前，\n就已经备受瞩目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45bb3a0a7464e65a5cbdeacfc9f2bdbe0f7f3cf7a7a828ef8dd8d21ea50d0569",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f08b769719ae3137471c5c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "试着想像鲁道夫象征会在这一年变得多强后，\n千明代表的内心就雀跃不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edd4250a45bb82bb1158fbd170f42149164b7c5e6a29c387d0ab1454704eb726",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9b344b1610ba8e713e3bab8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，葛城王牌落败后，\n对于自己只是个配角感到非常不甘心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04383dbe4e58f753cab0261ebe9d12a2aeb6fab7385beb1b4328e7811220f413",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
