    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30f5384b829abb0250a08065",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回程路上，葛城王牌听到有人在议论──\n虽然千明代表的比赛很有趣，\n但能够超越“神话”的是鲁道夫象征。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3459aee905319ba3798044a5091efa21b4de90c3497fbf6511196e589fff9f0e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc85c068d000b79bbe2b0ea6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表希望能在“日本杯”\n与竞争对手们一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d0f3b11765d08c9905a5e24819b55679ebdbe8d4f112ada43fcd077b7adcfbd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77353705907b487bc6e5549e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "获胜就能成为日本第一个战胜世界的赛马娘。\n千明代表本来预测鲁道夫象征会以这份荣耀\n为目标，但她似乎不打算参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c4411d6427352f63fbdbe96d8cdd65c2ef3d17682ff8f1fbb98dff377038395",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40b24812a39ca0d15bc3f273",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表和她约好要在“有马纪念”对决后，\n就开始为世界强者云集的“日本杯”做准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dafb1b9bbfc5770f6ac98affcbe58266f1ca37a5f64e44c4194634884fcabed0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057431.json",
      "json_path": [
